<BaseLayout title="About" description="Academic background and research axes.">
  <h1>About</h1>

  <h2>Academic background</h2>
  <p>
    I am a PhD candidate in quantum computing at Inria. Before that, I completed
    research internships focused on quantum circuits and formal methods.
  </p>

  <h2>Research axes</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Equational theories for quantum circuits (soundness / completeness)</li>
    <li>Qudit systems and circuit optimization</li>
    <li>Formal methods for quantum computing</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What I’m currently working on</h2>
  <p>
    I’m interested in building tools and proofs that make quantum programs easier
    to reason about and easier to optimize.
  </p>
